add('1729-Q07','distractors','Replace o2, which invents three independent thresholds whose conjunction is always a plane, with a coherent kernel misconception. A conjunction of coordinate thresholds is not generally a plane even before considering RBF, so this alternative combines unrelated errors instead of a meaningful competing boundary model.')
add('1730-Q07','distractors','Use plausible target_names/class-label ordering alternatives. Choosing a report row from the first sample probability and claiming that changing display labels retrains the SVC are conspicuously unrelated API effects; the item should test the actual label-order/display relationship.')
