add('1738-Q01','explanation sourceSupport','The o3 number99072 correctly counts dense weights only, while642 biases bring the total to99714. Its rationale says it omits642 biases from the dense weight count, which wrongly describes removing biases from a count that already excludes them; state that it omits biases from the total. The citation locator also claims two-angle targets on page1738, although that page shows hidden widths and fit, not target dimension; add page1731/1737 for the input/output dimensions.')
